---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<Base title="页面未找到" description="你访问的页面不存在。">
  <section class="container notfound">
    <div class="art" aria-hidden="true">
      <span>4</span>
      <span class="splat">✕</span>
      <span>4</span>
    </div>
    <h1>这页被画丢了</h1>
    <p>你要找的编号或页面不存在，试试回到风格库看看其他风格。</p>
    <div class="cta">
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href={`${base}`}>回到首页</a>
      <a class="btn" href={`${base}styles`}>浏览全部风格</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .notfound {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 6rem 1rem 5rem;
  }
  .art {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    font-size: 5.5rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--accent-ink);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .art .splat {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 400;
    transform: rotate(12deg);
  }
  .notfound h1 {
    font-size: 1.9rem;
  }
  .notfound p {
    color: var(--ink-mute);
    max-width: 34rem;
    margin: 0 auto 1.6rem;
  }
  .cta {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.7rem;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
</style>